HB0130 Homeowner tax exemption-amendments.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Heiner, Erickson, Haroldson, Kelly,
Locke, Lucas, Rodriguez-Williams and Webb and
Senator(s) Ide and Pearson
AN ACT relating to taxation; establishing a homeowner property tax exemption;
providing a sunset date; requiring rulemaking; repealing prior appropriations
and reverting funds to the general fund; providing an appropriation; and
providing for an effective date.
